; summer_trial.room - the summer song trials (docs/maps/README.md), left to right.
; Tested by tests/scenes/world/rooms/trials/summer_trial_test.gd; the trials
; assume a single jump (no double jump), like the rest of the trials.
;
; 1. The door that needs someone (design 02 section 8, Verao Espacial 1): the
;    gate only stands open while something weighs on the plate, and the plate
;    is too far from it to run. Sombra on the plate; Ivo walks through.
; 2. The seesaw (Verao Espacial 2): the cliff is out of reach from the floor,
;    the pedestal and a level plank. The pivot is off-centre: stand on the
;    long arm (it sinks to the floor), play Sombra, walk up to the short arm -
;    the shadow outweighs Ivo there, so it stays up - and jump to the cliff.
; 3. The lure (Verao Logico 1): a Brute Shadow holds the tunnel. Cast the
;    shadow in the open (col 45) before it wakes, climb onto the tunnel's roof
;    (the roof hides Ivo from it) to wake it: it goes for the shadow it can
;    see, and Ivo drops down the shaft behind it into the chamber. Or fight.

[room]
origin = 0, -16

